</B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Columbia Financial&#8217;s common stock is currently listed on the Nasdaq Global Select Market (&#8220;Nasdaq&#8221;) under the
trading symbol &#8220;CLBK.&#8221; We expect the shares of Columbia Financial, Inc. common stock will continue to be listed on </P>
