<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:8.5pt">Regulatory approvals for the merger may not be received, may take longer than expected or may impose conditions
that are not currently anticipated or that could have an adverse effect on Columbia Financial, Inc. following the closing. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
