<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:8.5pt">The market price for Columbia Financial, Inc. common stock following the closing of the merger may be affected
by factors different from those that historically have affected or currently affect Columbia Financial common stock. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
