 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B><A NAME="toc28556_6"></A>HOW WE INTEND TO USE THE PROCEEDS OF THE OFFERING </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Although we cannot determine what the actual net proceeds from the sale of the shares of common stock in the offering will be until the
offering is completed, we anticipate that the net proceeds will be between $966.0&nbsp;million and $1.9&nbsp;billion. See the section of this prospectus entitled &#8220;<I>Pro Forma Data&#8221;</I> for the assumptions used to arrive at these
amounts. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We intend to distribute the net proceeds as follows: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
