<p style="margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:0em; page-break-before:always"> </p>
<HR SIZE="3" style="COLOR:#999999" WIDTH="100%" ALIGN="CENTER">

<Center><DIV STYLE="width:8.5in" align="left">
 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At December&nbsp;31, 2025, 4.0% of PCD loans were past due 30 to 89 days, and 23.2% were
past due 90 days or more. At December&nbsp;31, 2024, 2.1% of PCD loans were past due 30 to 89 days, and 24.9% were past due 90 days or more. At December&nbsp;31, 2023, 2.9% of PCD loans were past due 30 to 89 days, and 27.1% were past due 90 days or
more. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following table sets forth the property types collateralizing <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-accrual</FONT> commercial
real estate loans <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">held-for</FONT> investment at December&nbsp;31, 2025: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
