<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">The amounts reported are the aggregate grant date fair value of the awards computed in accordance with the FASB
ASC Topic 718 for share-based payments. The grant date fair value for the PRSAs is equal to the number of awards multiplied by $16.23, the closing price of Columbia Financial&#8217;s common stock on the grant date. For the PRSAs, the
