annual installments commencing May&nbsp;1, 2024, one third of which vested on May&nbsp;1, 2024, one third which vested on May&nbsp;1, 2025 and one third of which are scheduled to vest on May&nbsp;1, 2026. For 2024, represents stock options granted
pursuant to the 2024 LTIP that vest in three equal installments, with one third of these options having vested on March&nbsp;3, 2025. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
