<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">These payments are subject to reduction if the parachute amounts associated with the payments under Section
280G of the Internal Revenue Code equal or exceed three times the executive&#8217;s average taxable compensation received from the Company for the five-year period ending on December&nbsp;31, 2025, and if the executive would receive on an after-tax
basis by reducing the payments that he or she would receive by getting all the payments and paying the 20% excise tax imposed by Section 4999 of the Internal Revenue Code. The potential reduction could be less or greater depending on the actual
circumstances at the time of a real transaction. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
