directors pursuant to a resolution adopted by a majority of the board or as otherwise provided in Columbia Financial&#8217;s bylaws; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
