</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">There were no contributions made to the Pension Plan during the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2025. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The weighted average actuarial assumptions used in the plan determinations at and for the years ended December&nbsp;31, 2025, 2024, and 2023
