<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Company, in the normal course of business, is party to commitments that involve, to varying degrees, elements of risk in excess of the
amounts recognized in the consolidated financial statements. These commitments include unused lines of credit and commitments to extend credit. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">At December&nbsp;31, 2025 and 2024, the following commitment and contingent liabilities existed that are not reflected in the accompanying
consolidated financial statements (in thousands): </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
